  "notes": [
    "**Llamar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Multiple meanings:",
    "To call (on the phone): *llamar por teléfono*",
    "To call/summon: *llamar a alguien*",
    "To knock (on door): *llamar a la puerta*",
    "Often used reflexively: **llamarse** (to be named/called)",
    "*Me llamo Juan* (My name is Juan / I'm called Juan)",
    "Common usage: *llamar a la policía* (to call the police), *¿Cómo te llamas?* (What's your name?)"
  ],
